{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FlexStreak 是一款為習慣建立而設的追蹤工具，適合容易因忙碌而放棄計劃、生活節奏不固定的人。它以彈性連續達標取代死板的每日打卡，讓你按自己的步調維持習慣。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>彈性連續達標習慣追蹤</h2>\n<p>FlexStreak 以彈性連續達標方式記錄習慣，每週完成七成目標即可維持紀錄，即使某天缺席亦不中斷，強調進度而非完美。介面為專注力較弱使用者而設，鼓勵而不批判，並支援自訂每日提醒。內置每週與每月圖表、成就徽章，透過 iCloud 同步至 Apple 裝置，亦設主畫面小工具。無需帳戶、沒有廣告，資料保持私密。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-78-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-79-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-80-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：flexstreak</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T05:59:18.986854+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}